          "The operator can make the escalation record usable, but should not invent the rationale for an approval that support lead never gave. The approver may accept, reject, or ask for more evidence, but the response should be recorded in the health score case rather than left in a chat. Review a sample of approvals each month to confirm that the named role still matches the current customer success process. If support lead delegates approval, record the delegate, the scope, the start time, and the end time. The October 28 health score recovery test should record the restore point and the escalation age result."
