          "For customer success work, review the oldest open health score and the most recently closed one side by side. Review the exception mix each month; a rising missing-evidence count may be an intake problem rather than an operator problem. Assign one owner and one due date to each review action, and check the action at the next sample. Compare the close evidence with the source rather than trusting the status field. The support lead decision on health score should be dated October 28 and linked to the health score note."
